==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Hawlucha|118}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Hawlucha}}.
*{{m|Take Down}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Hawlucha}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

